      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently highlight the tender care and patience shown to their pets, including senior dogs, nervous pups, and animals with sensitive skin or alopecia. Reviewers report that dogs leave the Midtown spa relaxed, happy, and sporting cute accessories like bows and rhinestones."
      }
    },
    {
