      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming reception and skilled groomers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the owner Marjo, Clara, and the entire grooming crew for their friendly attitude, clear communication, and personalized service. Long-time clients appreciate the welcoming atmosphere upon arrival and the attentive focus given to specific breed haircut instructions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
