      "title": {
        "en": "Runway-ready haircuts and fresh coats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews frequently praise the quality of styling, noting that dogs return home looking handsome, properly bathed, and smelling pleasant. Pet parents emphasize precise scissoring, effective de-shedding treatments, and stylish trims that keep their companions looking clean and neat."
      }
    }
